same, just more, and if that hasn't got you keen to play again, then WTF.\n\nUnfortunate that all progress was reset, but it doesn't really bother me.", "timestamp_created": 1660563510, "timestamp_updated": 1699771718, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.457651287317276001", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120652035", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009351809", "personaname": "Saedeas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198009351809/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1212, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 968, "last_played": 1719976241, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is an immensely satisfying fps roguelike.  The base progression system is similar to Rogue Legacy, and feels really good.  The runs themselves have quite a few possibilities and play differently depending on both class and specific build focus. The dev roadmap also looks extremely promising. I'll definitely be playing more.", "timestamp_created": 1660533023, "timestamp_updated": 1660533023, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}